body:
@yoavweiss thanks for clarifying the part I missed and extra test, that addresses the concern. I suppose if we are storing normalized URLs and specifiers, general string sharing should get pretty far and would be the required optimization.

The only remaining suggestion would be to replacing the `asURL` with a `isURLLike` and `isSpecialScheme` bool properties instead of storing all of `asURL`.

Other than that, signing off on this one and thanks for the great work.
